{
  "slug": "statusbar",
  "name": "Statusbar",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Customizable status bar for Claude Code that displays real-time session metrics at the bottom of the terminal. Shows model name, thinking effort level, context usage with visual bar, session cost, duration, git branch, rate limits, token counts, cache hit rate, and more.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `config` (Configure the status bar layout and widgets interactively, or apply a preset), `setup` (Set up, check status, or uninstall the statusbar plugin)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install statusbar@claude-community` from `SYM1000/claude-statusbar`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 2,
    "hook": 1
  },
